              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ibyah 18.2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Marayika wundi wa kabiri akurikiraho ati “Iraguye, iraguye! Babuloni wa mudugudu ukomeye, wateretse amahanga yose inzoga ari zo ruba ry'ubusambanyi bwawo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
