        {
          "text": "Hakurikiraho undi uvuye mu gicaniro ari we mutware w'umuriro, arangurura ijwi abwira wa marayika wundi ufite umuhoro utyaye ati “Ahura umuhoro wawe utyaye, uce amaseri yo ku muzabibu w'isi kuko inzabibu zawo zinetse.” ",
